Ms. Sonya Suliman Berce: Tapos po, ngayon po may solar panel na kami, wala na po kaming problema.

415
00:30:04,940 --> 00:30:09,380
Ms. Sonya Suliman Berce: Kaya po, inaasahan po namin na lalaki na po ang aming kitang mga magsasaka.

416
00:30:09,640 --> 00:30:16,220
Presentation video: Tunay ngang masaya ang lahat dahil napawi na rin ang kanilang pangamba na baka maputulan muli ng kuryente

417
00:30:16,220 --> 00:30:20,480
Presentation video: o hindi makapagbayad ng bill dahil sa taas ng singil.

418
00:30:21,360 --> 00:30:27,880
Presentation video: Pumaabot kasi ng hanggang P450,000 ang monthly bill sa kuryente ng SARF-C.

419
00:30:27,880 --> 00:30:33,880
Presentation video: Pero sa nakalipas na apat na buwan, gamit ang solar, wala na silang binabayaran.

420
00:30:35,140 --> 00:30:42,320
Presentation video: Gaya ng SARF-C, malaking hamon din sa Lumasba Multipurpose Cooperative sa bayan ng Minalabak, Camarena Sur,

421
00:30:42,720 --> 00:30:44,940
Presentation video: ang pagpapatubig gamit ang kuryente.

422
00:30:45,780 --> 00:30:49,880
Presentation video: Nalubog sila sa halos 10 milyong pisong pagkakautang sa Electric Cooperative.

423
00:30:51,140 --> 00:30:56,300
Presentation video: Ngunit nabuhayan ang kooperatiba nang mapaandar na ang kanilang irrigation system

424
00:30:56,300 --> 00:31:01,760
Presentation video: gamit ang Solar-Powered Pump Irrigation Project na ipinagkaloob ng NIA sa kanila.

425
00:31:02,540 --> 00:31:06,040
Presentation video: Isa sa mahigpit na isinusulong ni Pangulong Ferdinand Marcos Jr.

426
00:31:06,560 --> 00:31:12,140
Presentation video: ay ang modernisasyon ng mga irigasyon sa bansa at paggamit ng renewable energy

427
00:31:12,140 --> 00:31:19,400
Presentation video: na magbibigay daan sa mas matatag, maaasahan at napapanatiling pagsasaka sa Pilipinas.

428
00:31:19,400 --> 00:31:23,360
SARFC General Manager Arthur S. Rabeje: Maraming salamat sa National Irrigation Administration.

429
00:31:23,900 --> 00:31:25,060
SARFC General Manager Arthur S. Rabeje: Specialmente na.

430
00:31:25,060 --> 00:31:27,960
SARFC General Manager Arthur S. Rabeje: Si Pangulong Ferdinand Bongbong Marcos.

431
00:31:41,140 --> 00:31:47,340
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yes, sir. Good morning po. Good morning din po kay Sen. Imey Marcos.

432
00:31:47,980 --> 00:31:54,780
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Ma'am, meron din tayo mga solar pumps pala sa Ilocos. May tatlo tayong bagong pinagawa doon sa may nilagay po natin.

433
00:31:55,060 --> 00:31:56,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Sa San...

434
00:31:56,060 --> 00:31:58,740
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Ito sa San Nicolas.

435
00:31:59,240 --> 00:32:06,280
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: So, good morning po, Honorable Chairperson and Senator Francis Keiko Pailinan,

436
00:32:06,400 --> 00:32:11,820
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Distinguished Members of the Committee, fellow officials and staff of the National Irrigation Administration

437
00:32:11,820 --> 00:32:13,800
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: and our fellow public servants.

438
00:32:13,800 --> 00:32:20,400
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: On behalf of the National Irrigation, we are honored to present our Fiscal Year 2027 Budget Proposal.

439
00:32:20,860 --> 00:32:24,800
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: This proposal aims to accelerate the development and expansion of irrigation systems.

440
00:32:25,060 --> 00:32:28,540
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Rehabilitate and restore existing facilities.

441
00:32:29,120 --> 00:32:39,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Promote climate resilient irrigation technologies and strengthen the sustainability and reliability of irrigation services nationwide.

442
00:32:40,340 --> 00:32:40,940
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Next slide, please.

443
00:32:41,800 --> 00:32:48,280
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Our Fiscal Year 2027 Budget Proposal is firmly anchored in the 7-point strategic agenda.

444
00:32:48,280 --> 00:32:55,000
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: It serves as the strategic framework guiding the agency's priorities and investment.

445
00:32:55,060 --> 00:32:59,960
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: The 7 strategic agenda include Irrigation Infrastructure Development,

446
00:33:00,920 --> 00:33:03,800
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Irrigators Association Capacity Building,

447
00:33:04,360 --> 00:33:06,880
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Number 3, the Climate Smart Farming Systems,

448
00:33:07,620 --> 00:33:09,840
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Number 4, Management and Governance,

449
00:33:10,560 --> 00:33:12,380
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Number 5, the Monitoring and Evaluation,

450
00:33:12,900 --> 00:33:16,520
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: and Number 6, Capability Building of Human Resources,

451
00:33:16,740 --> 00:33:20,080
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: and Number 7, Strategic Communication and Advocacy.

452
00:33:22,120 --> 00:33:25,000
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: These strategic priorities ensure that NIA investments

453
00:33:25,400 --> 00:33:29,200
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Go beyond the construction and rehabilitation of facilities.

454
00:33:29,200 --> 00:33:32,520
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: They also focus on strengthening farmers' organizations,

455
00:33:33,160 --> 00:33:35,320
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: promoting climate resilient technologies,

456
00:33:35,680 --> 00:33:38,220
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: enhancing institutional efficiency,

457
00:33:39,280 --> 00:33:40,560
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: developing human resources,

458
00:33:40,900 --> 00:33:43,300
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: and improving stakeholder engagement.

459
00:33:43,880 --> 00:33:46,200
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Because of this integrated approach,

460
00:33:46,480 --> 00:33:49,820
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: NIA aims to deliver sustainable irrigation services

461
00:33:49,820 --> 00:33:53,980
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: that contribute to increased agricultural productivity,

462
00:33:54,460 --> 00:33:55,040
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: food security,

463
00:33:55,060 --> 00:33:58,320
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: and improve livelihoods for Filipino farmers.

464
00:33:59,760 --> 00:34:05,740
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: The National Irrigation Master Plan, NIMP, 2020-2030,

465
00:34:05,900 --> 00:34:10,080
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: serves as the country's strategic blueprint for irrigation development.

466
00:34:10,880 --> 00:34:16,220
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: It provides a comprehensive framework for expanding and modernizing irrigation systems

467
00:34:16,220 --> 00:34:21,300
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: to increase irrigated agricultural areas, enhance farm productivity,

468
00:34:21,300 --> 00:34:27,260
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: enhance food security, and help reduce poverty in rural communities.

469
00:34:27,500 --> 00:34:34,360
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Aligned with the NIMP, the NIA overarching objective is to contribute to food security

470
00:34:34,360 --> 00:34:39,580
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: and poverty reduction through accelerated and sustained irrigation development

471
00:34:39,580 --> 00:34:44,480
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: under diversified and climate-resilient crop production systems.

472
00:34:44,780 --> 00:34:48,200
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: By providing reliable and efficient irrigation services,

473
00:34:48,340 --> 00:34:51,200
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: NIA enables farmers to increase cropping efficiency,

474
00:34:51,300 --> 00:34:54,440
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: intensity, improve agricultural productivity,

475
00:34:55,460 --> 00:35:00,460
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: reduce vulnerability to drought and other climate-related risks,

476
00:35:00,460 --> 00:35:05,840
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: and ultimately raise farm incomes and improve their quality of life.

477
00:35:07,600 --> 00:35:09,960
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: To strengthen our planning framework,

478
00:35:11,460 --> 00:35:14,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: NIA updated the country's potential irrigable area

479
00:35:14,060 --> 00:35:17,160
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: through the Regional Irrigation Master Plan,

480
00:35:17,720 --> 00:35:21,160
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: incorporating the latest geospatial and technical data from

481
00:35:21,300 --> 00:35:28,080
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: agencies such as the BSWM, DENR, NWRB, PHIVOLCS, and NCIP.

482
00:35:29,120 --> 00:35:33,840
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: This ensures that irrigation investments are guided and more accurate

483
00:35:33,840 --> 00:35:40,540
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: and validated data and directed toward areas with greatest development potential.

484
00:35:41,160 --> 00:35:42,760
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Based on the updated assessment,

485
00:35:42,760 --> 00:35:48,760
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: the country has a gross potential irrigable area of 9.16 million hectares.

486
00:35:49,520 --> 00:35:51,220
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: After considering applicable techniques,

487
00:35:51,300 --> 00:35:54,340
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: technical environment, and other constraints,

488
00:35:54,820 --> 00:36:00,420
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: the net potential irrigable area is estimated at 4.65 million hectares.

489
00:36:00,420 --> 00:36:08,400
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Of this, approximately 4.24 million hectares fall within the 0-8% range,

490
00:36:09,060 --> 00:36:12,840
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: including 3.05 million hectares at 0-3%,

491
00:36:12,840 --> 00:36:16,420
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: and 1.19 million hectares at 3-8%.

492
00:36:17,160 --> 00:36:21,280
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: The assessment also identified additional potential areas,

493
00:36:21,300 --> 00:36:22,170
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Question lang.

494
00:36:22,170 --> 00:36:22,740
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yes, ma'am.

495
00:36:22,740 --> 00:36:27,700
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Yung net ninyo versus gross potential irrigable area,

496
00:36:28,040 --> 00:36:30,660
Senator Imee R. Marcos: ibig sabihin niyan minus what's already irrigated?

497
00:36:31,480 --> 00:36:34,000
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Or what do you mean by net and gross?

498
00:36:34,540 --> 00:36:36,160
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Dito sa chart.

499
00:36:36,580 --> 00:36:39,260
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Dan sa ilalim, yung 9.16.

500
00:36:39,560 --> 00:36:43,180
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yung 9.16, yan po yung gross potential.

501
00:36:43,360 --> 00:36:45,600
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Pwede natin irrigate kasi may mga mataas.

502
00:36:45,920 --> 00:36:48,480
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So that's the maximum that's irrigable?

503
00:36:48,740 --> 00:36:49,020
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yes, ma'am.

504
00:36:49,020 --> 00:36:51,120
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Paano yung 4.65? Bakit siya net?

505
00:36:51,300 --> 00:36:52,680
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Already irrigated?

506
00:36:53,240 --> 00:36:55,040
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Minus what's already irrigated?

507
00:36:55,160 --> 00:36:59,100
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: No, ma'am. Ito po yung potentially irrigable talaga.

508
00:36:59,480 --> 00:37:01,220
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Up to 8% slope.

509
00:37:02,180 --> 00:37:03,280
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: So dati po kasi...

510
00:37:03,280 --> 00:37:04,020
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Bakit magkaiba?

511
00:37:04,540 --> 00:37:05,380
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Okay, ma'am.

512
00:37:05,700 --> 00:37:11,380
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Ito pong 9.16 million hectares kasi is hanggang sa 30-40% slope.

513
00:37:11,620 --> 00:37:13,640
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kasi yung mga upland communities po natin,

514
00:37:14,240 --> 00:37:16,420
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: may mga upland communities po tayo.

515
00:37:16,680 --> 00:37:18,200
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: But yung po kasing irrigable...

516
00:37:18,200 --> 00:37:20,200
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Pero mabigat na yung 30-40%.

517
00:37:21,300 --> 00:37:22,780
Senator Imee R. Marcos: 30% slope, mabigat na yun.

518
00:37:22,860 --> 00:37:23,300
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yes, ma'am.

519
00:37:23,320 --> 00:37:24,880
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So yung realidad, yung 4.65.

520
00:37:24,880 --> 00:37:25,880
Senator Imee R. Marcos: 4.65.

521
00:37:26,120 --> 00:37:27,060
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ano yung slope?

522
00:37:27,280 --> 00:37:28,620
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Anong slope sa dyan sa baba?

523
00:37:28,880 --> 00:37:30,320
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: 0 to 8% po.

524
00:37:30,660 --> 00:37:35,480
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yung original po na master plan natin is based lamang po sa 0 to 3%,

525
00:37:35,480 --> 00:37:37,180
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: yung 3.2 million hectares po.

526
00:37:38,980 --> 00:37:40,120
Senator Imee R. Marcos: That was the original.

527
00:37:40,440 --> 00:37:43,220
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: But nung gumawa po kami ng regional irrigation master plan,

528
00:37:43,640 --> 00:37:46,260
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: we found out po na meron pa around 1 million hectares

529
00:37:46,260 --> 00:37:49,260
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: na papasok doon sa 0 to 8% natin.

530
00:37:50,340 --> 00:37:50,700
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Okay.

531
00:37:51,300 --> 00:37:52,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Apo.

532
00:37:53,920 --> 00:37:57,200
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: The assessment also identified additional potential areas

533
00:37:57,200 --> 00:37:59,280
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: beyond the traditional slope criteria.

534
00:37:59,920 --> 00:38:03,800
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Again, including areas with a slope of 8 to 18%,

535
00:38:03,800 --> 00:38:05,080
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: 18 to 45%,

536
00:38:05,080 --> 00:38:07,480
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: and even above 45%,

537
00:38:07,480 --> 00:38:09,820
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: subject to site-specific suitability.

538
00:38:10,180 --> 00:38:16,160
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Ito po yung mga ginagamitan po ng pipe irrigation.

539
00:38:16,540 --> 00:38:17,200
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kaya po pwede...

540
00:38:17,200 --> 00:38:19,360
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Sa Cebu po, meron ganito tayong project.

541
00:38:19,360 --> 00:38:20,360
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Up to 45%.

542
00:38:21,300 --> 00:38:24,800
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Pwede po naman i-irrigate sila.

543
00:38:24,960 --> 00:38:26,840
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kaya lang pipe system na po.

544
00:38:27,720 --> 00:38:30,180
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: So, as of December 31, 2025,

545
00:38:30,400 --> 00:38:32,980
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: the country has developed 2.2 million hectares

546
00:38:32,980 --> 00:38:36,940
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: out of the total estimated potentially irrigable area.

547
00:38:37,140 --> 00:38:39,860
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Ito yung original po na 3.13 million hectares

548
00:38:39,860 --> 00:38:44,760
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: representing 70.25% of the country's irrigation potential.

549
00:38:45,380 --> 00:38:48,620
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Around 1 million hectares or approximately 30%

550
00:38:48,620 --> 00:38:50,300
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: remain to be developed.

551
00:38:50,620 --> 00:38:50,900
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Sandali.

552
00:38:51,060 --> 00:38:51,280
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Sandali.

553
00:38:51,300 --> 00:38:54,280
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So, anong figurang gagamitin natin?

554
00:38:54,420 --> 00:38:56,920
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yung 3.3 or yung 4.6?

555
00:38:57,080 --> 00:39:00,460
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yung 3.13 million muna, sir.

556
00:39:01,100 --> 00:39:03,080
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kasi yung original natin na NIM.

557
00:39:03,760 --> 00:39:04,060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: I know.

558
00:39:04,160 --> 00:39:05,580
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Pero moving forward,

559
00:39:05,760 --> 00:39:09,480
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: shouldn't you already transition to 4.6?

560
00:39:09,640 --> 00:39:10,020
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Kasi...

561
00:39:10,020 --> 00:39:10,440
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yes, sir.

562
00:39:11,100 --> 00:39:14,800
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Otherwise, parang maganda yung 70%.

563
00:39:14,800 --> 00:39:17,740
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Pero ano siya sa 4.6?

564
00:39:18,540 --> 00:39:18,900
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yes, sir.

565
00:39:18,900 --> 00:39:20,900
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Hindi namin dinideclare po kasi pinapa...

566
00:39:21,180 --> 00:39:25,980
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yung 70%

567
00:39:25,980 --> 00:39:31,440
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: ang accomplishment na developed areas

568
00:39:31,440 --> 00:39:33,660
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: doon sa 3.13.

569
00:39:34,080 --> 00:39:34,340
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Tama?

570
00:39:34,820 --> 00:39:35,300
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Tama po.

571
00:39:35,460 --> 00:39:35,660
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Oo.

572
00:39:35,900 --> 00:39:38,040
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Pero ano siya...

573
00:39:38,040 --> 00:39:40,640
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kailangan lang po kasi, Mr. Chair,

574
00:39:40,740 --> 00:39:42,100
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: yung approval din ng DA.

575
00:39:42,460 --> 00:39:44,580
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kailangan mag-conform po sila doon sa four-point...

576
00:39:44,580 --> 00:39:46,620
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: bago natin po pwede siyang i-declare totally.

577
00:39:47,100 --> 00:39:48,900
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: And i-approve din po ng NIA Board.

578
00:39:49,060 --> 00:39:51,200
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: So, pinapa-approve pa po natin sa DA.

579
00:39:51,300 --> 00:39:52,600
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Magko-conform si Secretary.

580
00:39:52,860 --> 00:39:53,540
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Then, NIA Board.

581
00:39:53,800 --> 00:39:55,340
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: And then, yun na po yung i-adapt natin,

582
00:39:55,580 --> 00:39:55,980
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Mr. Chair.

583
00:39:56,520 --> 00:39:56,880
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Okay.

584
00:39:57,120 --> 00:39:58,980
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And when do you expect to do that?

585
00:39:59,120 --> 00:40:01,080
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Kasi lahat ng figura mo,

586
00:40:01,200 --> 00:40:02,760
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: lahat ng computations mo,

587
00:40:02,900 --> 00:40:04,740
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: lahat ng budget projections mo,

588
00:40:04,800 --> 00:40:10,300
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: will obviously adjust to a new benchmark.

589
00:40:11,020 --> 00:40:11,700
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yes, Mr. Chair.

590
00:40:11,780 --> 00:40:12,980
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kaya napapirmahan na po namin

591
00:40:12,980 --> 00:40:17,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: kay Secretary Laurel yung joint po natin.

592
00:40:17,400 --> 00:40:18,940
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Ipapresenta po natin sa Board po.

593
00:40:18,940 --> 00:40:20,460
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: So, within this year po,

594
00:40:20,560 --> 00:40:21,260
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: mako-complete.

595
00:40:21,460 --> 00:40:22,960
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: May i-adjust na po natin.

596
00:40:23,740 --> 00:40:26,120
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So, you expect a different

597
00:40:26,120 --> 00:40:31,380
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: 2028 budgetary appropriations

598
00:40:31,380 --> 00:40:34,800
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: at least based on a larger area

599
00:40:34,800 --> 00:40:36,400
