NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Saan mo kukunin po ang tubig nun?

5536
04:06:12,060 --> 04:06:15,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kung hindi ka mag-impound sa taas.

5537
04:06:15,060 --> 04:06:20,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: So heating multiple birds with one stone po ito eh.

5538
04:06:20,060 --> 04:06:22,060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Bulk water.

5539
04:06:22,060 --> 04:06:23,060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Potable water.

5540
04:06:23,060 --> 04:06:24,060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Irrigation.

5541
04:06:24,060 --> 04:06:26,060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Flood control.

5542
04:06:26,060 --> 04:06:27,060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Power.

5543
04:06:27,060 --> 04:06:28,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Aquaculture.

5544
04:06:28,060 --> 04:06:29,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Aquaculture.

5545
04:06:29,060 --> 04:06:34,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Tapos may tourism ano pa po ito dahil may nalungkaw po ito eh.

5546
04:06:34,060 --> 04:06:37,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: So mababawi po ito.

5547
04:06:37,060 --> 04:06:41,060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: With the permission lang of our chairperson of the finance committee.

5548
04:06:41,060 --> 04:06:46,060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: We would probably estimate maybe kung 20 billion yan, it should be about 30 billion now.

5549
04:06:46,060 --> 04:06:47,060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So Balintingon.

5550
04:06:47,060 --> 04:06:49,060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Then 6 billion and 8.

5551
04:06:49,060 --> 04:06:53,060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So this is about 36 plus 8.

5552
04:06:53,060 --> 04:06:55,060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: 45 billion.

5553
04:06:55,060 --> 04:06:56,060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: For this 3.

5554
04:06:56,060 --> 04:06:58,060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: For Central Luzon.

5555
04:06:58,060 --> 04:06:59,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yes, Mr. Chair.

5556
04:06:59,060 --> 04:07:03,060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: But we have to realize yung mga ganyan po kalaking project baka 5 years gawin yan.

5557
04:07:03,060 --> 04:07:06,060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So hindi naman minsanan po na budget natin yan.

5558
04:07:06,060 --> 04:07:10,060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So maybe bigyan natin siya sa una.

5559
04:07:10,060 --> 04:07:12,060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Bigyan mo muna ng say 2 billion.

5560
04:07:12,060 --> 04:07:15,060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Pagka tumaas na yung say 3 billion a year.

5561
04:07:15,060 --> 04:07:19,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Sir, ito yung contention po ng NIA dito.

5562
04:07:19,060 --> 04:07:21,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: We have 18 major river basins.

5563
04:07:21,060 --> 04:07:23,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: To give you an idea.

5564
04:07:23,060 --> 04:07:26,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yun pong halaw or dam natin.

5565
04:07:26,060 --> 04:07:31,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Eh yun lang pagtayo nung dam na malaki is nasa 10 billion po yun.

5566
04:07:31,060 --> 04:07:33,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yung tatlong dam na yun ah.

5567
04:07:33,060 --> 04:07:34,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yung malaki na yun.

5568
04:07:34,060 --> 04:07:41,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: So if we have 18 major river basins then kailangan mo po doon kung 10 billion ang ilagay mo sa isang dam lang po ito ah.

5569
04:07:41,060 --> 04:07:43,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Wala pa yung irrigation facilities.

5570
04:07:43,060 --> 04:07:45,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Di 180 billion.

5571
04:07:45,060 --> 04:07:47,060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: That's for 5 years.

5572
04:07:47,060 --> 04:07:49,060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Hindi mo naman kailangan punduhan.

5573
04:07:49,060 --> 04:07:50,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yes, opo.

5574
04:07:50,060 --> 04:08:00,060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So kung lahat yun, bigyan mo natin ng 2 billion, 36 billion lamang a year ang tanggalin natin sa flood control at ilagay sa dam.

5575
04:08:00,060 --> 04:08:01,060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Over how many years?

5576
04:08:01,060 --> 04:08:02,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: For 5 years sir.

5577
04:08:02,060 --> 04:08:05,060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So 36 billion annually for 5 years?

5578
04:08:05,060 --> 04:08:06,060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: For 5 years.

5579
04:08:06,060 --> 04:08:08,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yun lang tanggalin mo sa…

5580
04:08:08,060 --> 04:08:12,060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Eh yung 2 years ng flood control, trillion pesos eh.

5581
04:08:16,060 --> 04:08:17,060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Hindi, dapat sana…

5582
04:08:17,060 --> 04:08:18,060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Wala nang baha.

5583
04:08:18,060 --> 04:08:19,060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Wala nang baha.

5584
04:08:19,060 --> 04:08:20,060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Di ba?

5585
04:08:20,060 --> 04:08:28,060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: At meron na tayong magandang bulk water, meron na tayong magandang irrigation, meron pa tayong magandang hydropower.

5586
04:08:28,060 --> 04:08:33,060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Sa halagang a year for 5 years.

5587
04:08:33,060 --> 04:08:36,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: At saka sir, ito po ang pinaka…

5588
04:08:36,060 --> 04:08:47,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Napansin namin po kung nasaan yung mga dams natin like Magat and Pantabangan, yung lahat ng service area niya napakababa po ng poverty incidents compared mo sa walang irrigation.

5589
04:08:47,060 --> 04:08:59,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Ang amin po kasi sa NIA, ang tingin natin, hindi naman tingin, ang assessment po natin sa ating mga farmers, lahat po sila underemployed eh dahil sa sitwasyon ngayon.

5590
04:08:59,060 --> 04:09:07,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Pero pag in-increase mo yung ginandahan mo yung irrigation, nagiging more productive sila, bumababa po talaga ang poverty.

5591
04:09:07,060 --> 04:09:16,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Hindi lamang po natin ito, ang tinutuguran natin dito hindi lang po flooding, hindi lang po food security but poverty alleviation po talaga itong program.

5592
04:09:16,060 --> 04:09:24,060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kailan pa ba ito? Siguro tanong ko lang sir chair, yung nabanggit niya Pantabangan, dami itong mga major dams natin parang…

5593
04:09:24,060 --> 04:09:25,060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: 50 years.

5594
04:09:25,060 --> 04:09:33,060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kailan? Parang wala akong narinig na nadagdag na eh no, matapos itong mga major dams na ito. Meron ba?

5595
04:09:33,060 --> 04:09:34,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Jalaur na lamang.

5596
04:09:34,060 --> 04:09:37,060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Jalaur lang, sa Iloilo pa, sa Iloilo, sa Iloilo yun, di ba?

5597
04:09:37,060 --> 04:09:38,060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Iloilo pa.

5598
04:09:38,060 --> 04:09:45,060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Hindi, pero maganda yung sinabi ng chairman, he pointed that out na kung kaya natin itong multi-year na tagtutubi yun.

5599
04:09:46,060 --> 04:09:54,060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sinabi niyo, masimulan lang. Kaya ito pala eh 2013 pa lang nasa plano na hindi lang naisagawa, no?

5600
04:09:54,060 --> 04:09:59,060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kasi nga parang nangyayari Mr. Chair mukhang napaghahati-hatian.

5601
04:09:59,060 --> 04:10:10,060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ang mga ano, parang just like in any other department or agencies, instead na mag-concentrate tayo rin sa mga big-ticket items na mga dapat gawin, no?

5602
04:10:10,060 --> 04:10:14,060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Eh, patsi-patsi. Di ba? Pero para sa akin kasi, kung gagastos rin lang tayo sa irrigation…

5603
04:10:14,060 --> 04:10:20,060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kung gagastos rin lang tayo sa irrigation, pero kung wala rin nadali na tubig, parang sayang, no?

5604
04:10:20,060 --> 04:10:28,060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, we really need to think about the retention, itong mga water retention facilities already, masimulan man lang.

5605
04:10:28,060 --> 04:10:38,060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Although masikip ang fiscal space natin ngayon, admittedly, pero kung kailangan natin gawin, eh kailan pa kung hindi pa natin gagawin, ano?

5606
04:10:38,060 --> 04:10:41,060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, maganda yung sinong-point out ng ating chairman.

5607
04:10:41,060 --> 04:10:43,060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We'll be hitting hindi lang two birds with one stone. Maraming salamat.

5608
04:10:43,060 --> 04:10:46,060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Two birds with one stone, maraming bagay, no?

5609
04:10:46,060 --> 04:10:59,060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ah, yung mitigation ng flooding, magagawa natin, magkontrol natin yung flooding, magkakanta tayo ng bulk water, potable water, at iba pa, irrigation, no? Napakarami.

5610
04:10:59,060 --> 04:11:00,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Hydropower.

5611
04:11:00,060 --> 04:11:02,060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Hydropower pa. So, limang bagay.

5612
04:11:02,060 --> 04:11:13,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Sir, Mr. Chair, actually, Mr. Chair, ang totoo niyan, hindi rin na i-coconsider. Sa palagay namin sa NIA, ang isang pinaka-importante pong papel ng ating mga dams.

5613
04:11:13,060 --> 04:11:30,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Ito po ang recharge point ng ating aquifer. Dahil po lahat po ng ilog natin ngayon, Mr. Chair, ay silted na, eh. Tapos nilagyan pa natin ang mga dikes along the river. So, lalong bumilis ang velocity ng tubig ngayon.

5614
04:11:30,060 --> 04:11:33,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Natatapon lang. Tinatapon lang yung tubig.

5615
04:11:33,060 --> 04:11:42,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: So, kailangan mo talaga po ng pangharang. Kaya noon pa namin sinasuggest yung mga sabo dams. Because kailangan mo ng pangharang dito. Dahil pagka bumagal ang velocity ng tubig, naipon niya.

5616
04:11:42,060 --> 04:11:55,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yun ang strategic po na recharge point ng ating mga aquifers. Eh, sa Central Luzon, puro underground water po yung mga yan. Malamang po yan, you know, ubos na yung...

5617
04:11:55,060 --> 04:12:11,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kailangan po natin talaga na... Pwede namin ipakita po sa inyo. Yung, Mr. Chair, hindi nakita ng ating chairperson kanina, yung ginagawa po natin sa Cabiao. Actually, pinaaral po ng presidente sa amin yan. Sabi niya, gawa kami ng paraan na hindi nilalagyan.

5618
04:12:11,060 --> 04:12:38,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: na hindi natin hukayin po yung mga palaya ng mga farmers natin. Dahil doon po nagkakaroon ng problema eh. So, nung ginawa namin ng pag-aaral, nakita namin, ang luluwang pala ng mga megadikes natin at ang hahaba. Yung sa... Binanggit ko na po kanina, yung sa Cabiao alone is 500 meters wide by 6 kilometers long. So, 12 million cubic meters na po kagad ang pwede nating ma-impound doon. Which is immediately above Candaba.

5619
04:12:38,060 --> 04:12:40,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kaya na niyang...

5620
04:12:40,060 --> 04:12:56,260
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kaya na niyang hugutin yung baha sa Candaba, Mr. Chair, pag nabuo natin yan. Ginagawa na po namin, Mr. Chair, ang... Pero ang pundo na ilagay lang ng niya is good for 1.5 kilometers. May remaining pa po na 4.5 kilometers.

5621
04:12:57,260 --> 04:12:59,180
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: 3 million cubic meters po yan, Mr. Chair.

5622
04:12:59,200 --> 04:13:01,820
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: 3 million cubic liters pag 1.5.

5623
04:13:01,820 --> 04:13:05,400
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: 1.5, yes po. Pero, you know, again...

5624
04:13:05,400 --> 04:13:09,400
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Is that the only project now being undertaken?

5625
04:13:10,060 --> 04:13:12,780
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yes po, Mr. Chair. Yan lang po kasi...

5626
04:13:12,780 --> 04:13:14,120
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Sa megadike na sinasabi nyo?

5627
04:13:14,880 --> 04:13:20,080
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yan po yung cut cement area na sinasabi, na binabanggit po. Yan po labang po kasi...

5628
04:13:20,080 --> 04:13:28,420
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So, ilang pang mga katulad nito ang kailangan para masakop yung sinasabi ninyong megadike area?

5629
04:13:28,420 --> 04:13:38,420
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yung, again, in Cabiao, Dinabao Lake, Mr. Chair, malaki rin po yun. Around, sa estimate namin, umabot din siya na around...

5630
04:13:38,420 --> 04:13:39,420
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: No, no, this is solid.

5631
04:13:40,060 --> 04:13:42,120
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yung existing area mo, yung Cabiao?

5632
04:13:42,440 --> 04:13:47,460
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Cabiao, opo. May nabao lake pa po doon, Mr. Chair. Nabao lake. Ganun din.

5633
04:13:48,440 --> 04:13:52,440
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Meron pa tayong Google, ano? Pwede ba natin ipakita yung sa Google Earth?

5634
04:13:53,300 --> 04:13:53,960
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Google Earth.

5635
04:13:54,940 --> 04:13:56,860
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Google Earth, para makita nila yung actual.

5636
04:13:56,860 --> 04:14:09,820
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So, ilang water impounding ang dapat gawin, at least initially, para doon sa sinasabing yung ilang hect kilometers ng megadike?

5637
04:14:10,060 --> 04:14:13,120
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Um, yung sa...

5638
04:14:13,120 --> 04:14:18,820
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Sa Cabiao pa, sir. 20 kilometers na yung sa Cabiao, eh. By 300 meters.

5639
04:14:19,300 --> 04:14:26,040
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: You're saying, sa buong 300 meters na yun, kailangan magandang lagyan ng... What is the term?

5640
04:14:26,940 --> 04:14:27,720
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Detention pond?

5641
04:14:27,880 --> 04:14:37,600
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yes, yes, Mr. Chair. Wala kang bibilihin na lupa, wala kang ilulubog na palayan. So, wala... I mean, shovel ready yung ganyan project, eh.

5642
04:14:37,600 --> 04:14:40,040
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And that will give you a potable water?

5643
04:14:40,060 --> 04:14:42,240
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Potable water, irrigation.

5644
04:14:43,020 --> 04:14:43,620
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And irrigation.

5645
04:14:43,940 --> 04:14:47,900
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yes, sir. Aquaculture. Tsaka, yan, Mr. Chair, pwede rin...

5646
04:14:47,900 --> 04:14:55,120
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Okay, no. But you haven't answered the question. How many? Kasi isa lang ginagawa ninyo. Kailan makukompleto to?

5647
04:14:55,980 --> 04:14:58,000
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Next year po yung 1.5 kilometers.

5648
04:14:58,320 --> 04:14:59,880
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: 1.5. So, ilang kilometers?

5649
04:15:00,000 --> 04:15:01,820
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: 4.5 kilometers pa po.

5650
04:15:01,840 --> 04:15:02,740
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So, kailangan pa nun.

5651
04:15:03,440 --> 04:15:05,380
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So, walang problema yun.

5652
04:15:05,500 --> 04:15:07,180
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Kung may pondo, magagawa lahat yun.

5653
04:15:07,780 --> 04:15:10,220
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: At saka may approval po ang DNR dyan.

5654
04:15:10,340 --> 04:15:12,480
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And ang total nyan is 9 million, you said?

5655
04:15:12,840 --> 04:15:14,420
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Na 12 million cubic meters.

5656
04:15:14,440 --> 04:15:21,860
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: 12 million na mamamanage mo for potable or for hydro or for aquaculture or for irrigation.

5657
04:15:22,240 --> 04:15:22,680
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yes, sir.

5658
04:15:23,120 --> 04:15:26,160
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: At saka directly above ng kandaba.

5659
04:15:26,980 --> 04:15:28,880
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: So, you know.

5660
04:15:28,880 --> 04:15:30,240
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So, ba't hindi ginagawa?

5661
04:15:31,880 --> 04:15:34,440
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Ang tanong, ba't hindi pinupondohan, Mr. Chair?

5662
04:15:35,540 --> 04:15:37,060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Ginagawa namin, pero...

5663
04:15:37,060 --> 04:15:40,560
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Kasama ba yun dun sa 200 million na budget na [unclear]?

5664
04:15:40,600 --> 04:15:42,620
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yes, yes, Mr. Chair, dun sa request namin.

5665
04:15:43,020 --> 04:15:45,860
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Or can you separate that and give us a budget for that?

5666
04:15:46,260 --> 04:15:51,340
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yung computation ninyo ng budget for the how many kilometers?

5667
04:15:53,820 --> 04:15:55,140
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: 4.5 kilometers.

5668
04:15:55,940 --> 04:15:57,440
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Low hanging fruit yun eh.

5669
04:15:58,880 --> 04:15:59,600
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Go ahead, sir.

5670
04:16:00,080 --> 04:16:03,820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Likewise, siguro, admit, pakibigayin na lang po sa ating Vice Chair

5671
04:16:03,820 --> 04:16:09,280
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: because he will be the one to recommend to the Chair yung inyo pong budget

5672
04:16:09,280 --> 04:16:12,360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: at yung mga proposed programs.

5673
04:16:13,280 --> 04:16:16,040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yun nga, maganda makita na natin yung pang long term.

5674
04:16:16,420 --> 04:16:18,240
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yun ang kula sa atin talaga, yung master plan eh.

5675
04:16:19,260 --> 04:16:22,700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Laging kung ano lang ang pwede, may patsi-patsi proyekto,

5676
04:16:22,760 --> 04:16:24,200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: kailangan natin pang matagala na.

5677
04:16:24,200 --> 04:16:28,760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I think we are in agreement ng aming Senator Kiko

5678
04:16:28,880 --> 04:16:33,220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: na I think pwede na natin simulan itong mga water impounding,

5679
04:16:33,340 --> 04:16:34,580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: water retention facilities.

5680
04:16:34,700 --> 04:16:35,540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kailangan na gawin eh.

5681
04:16:35,620 --> 04:16:37,320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kailangan ito ginawa kahapon pa eh.

5682
04:16:37,780 --> 04:16:39,320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Diba? Yesterday ito dapat eh.

5683
04:16:40,040 --> 04:16:40,300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Diba?

5684
04:16:40,960 --> 04:16:43,560
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So kung pwedeng magpasa kayo,

5685
04:16:45,480 --> 04:16:48,160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: yun po eh, mga dams na kininumerate.

5686
04:16:48,360 --> 04:16:53,100
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Tapos yung multi-year, kung magkano ang tingin yung budget na pwedeng kahit pasimulan

5687
